{'symbol': 'NDAQ', 'date': '2022-03-11 16:05:00', 'title': 'DELISTING OF SECURITIES OF TRITERRAS, INC.\xa0FROM\xa0THE\xa0NASDAQ STOCK MARKET', 'text': "NEW YORK, MARCH 11, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- THE NASDAQ STOCK MARKET ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT WILL DELIST THE CLASS A ORDINARY SHARES AND WARRANTS OF TRITERRAS, INC. TRITERRAS, INC.'S SECURITIES WERE SUSPENDED ON FEBRUARY 3, 2022, AND HAVE NOT TRADED ON NASDAQ SINCE THAT TIME."}